   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Development Fund 2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programme Development Fund 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programutvecklings fonden (PDF) ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r programstuderande f&#xf6;rberedelser och bed&#xf6;mningar, kapacitetsuppbyggnad p&#xe5; partner system och f&#xf6;rfaranden, externa bed&#xf6;mningar, utv&#xe4;rderingar, revisioner, policy unders&#xf6;kningar och r&#xe5;d i form av konsultering. Syftet med fonden &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kvaliteten p&#xe5; utvecklingssamarbetet och f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; m&#xe5;len i strategin f&#xf6;r Zimbabwe.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme development fund (PDF) is to be used for programme preparations and assessments, capacity building on partner systems and procedures, external appraisals, evaluations, audits, policy studies and advises in the form of consultancies. The purpose of the fund is to increase the quality of the development cooperation activities and to achieve the goals of the strategy for aid interventions in Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
